      "reviewer": "OpenAI Codex",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-24T12:30:55Z",
      "note": "Reviewed the exploit receipt and call trace, the verified PresaleV4 implementation, the commit-pinned reproduction, the deployment transaction, the exploit-time implementation slot, and a complete Upgraded-event query from deployment through the exploit. The exploit executes buyWithEthDynamic through proxy 0x1f006f43f57c45ceb3659e543352b4fae4662df7 and delegates to 0xdb0618e0b850cab3f756d030398be22929226d5c. PresaleV4.fetchPrice obtains a live router quote, which the attacker manipulates atomically before buying the remaining BTC20 inventory. Six Upgraded events exist; the last is log 181 of 0x7f3be68657ca2dcb4eb8ebf3681e65b0fee509b693bcab627c212e34fd47947f and selects the recorded implementation. After repaying the flash loan, the trace transfers exactly 18.348059243787394323 ETH to the attacker."
